[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 28500.07, "timestamp": "07:55:00", "text": "例如俄罗斯。不，但为什么这个按钮这么……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28502.948, "timestamp": "07:55:02", "text": "大的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28523.27, "timestamp": "07:55:23", "text": "我是否属于法定盲人？我错过了什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28525.59, "timestamp": "07:55:25", "text": "这里面有什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28529.43, "timestamp": "07:55:29", "text": "那里怎么会小呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28532.708, "timestamp": "07:55:32", "text": "但当你变得非常非常大时，你就会觉得，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28535.83, "timestamp": "07:55:35", "text": "“是啊，我想出人头地。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28549.51, "timestamp": "07:55:49", "text": "好的，我把所有东西都设为零。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28557.99, "timestamp": "07:55:57", "text": "我觉得这就像是位置决定一切。"}]